1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:15,000
残酷な天使のように 少年よ 神話になれ

2
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:37,000
青い風が今 胸のドアを叩いても 私だけをただ見つめて 微笑んでるあなた

3
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:52,000
そっと触れるもの 求めることに夢中で 運命さえまだ知らない 痛い気な瞳

4
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:59,000
だけどいつか気づくでしょう その背中には

5
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:07,000
遥か未来 目指すための羽根があること

6
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:14,000
残酷な天使の定世 窓辺からやがて到達

7
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:22,000
ほとばしる熱いパッドスで 思い出を裏切るなら

8
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
この空を抱いて輝く 少年よ 神話になれ

9
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:31,000
ママ!

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,000
ママ!

11
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:34,000
ママ! They chose me!

12
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
I'm an elite pilot now!

13
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
I'm the best in the whole world now!

14
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,000
I must keep this a secret, but I'll only tell you,ママ!

15
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Everybody's so nice to me now!

16
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,000
I don't feel lonely anymore!

17
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
I'm okay now!

18
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Even without Papa!

19
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Look at me!

20
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Look at me,ママ!

21
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Look,ママ!

22
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Look,ママ!

23
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Sing ratio zero

24
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,000
I can't be the second child anymore

25
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
No reason left to live

26
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:17,000
Nobody cares about me anymore

27
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:20,000
My father, my mother, nobody cares

28
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,000
I have no reason left to live

29
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:33,000
Are you Oscar Langley, so are you?

30
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Intelligence Division 2 just took the second child into protective custody

31
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Right

32
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,000
It isn't like them to lose her in the first place

33
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
And then it takes seven days to find her

34
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:45,000
They must have done it on purpose

35
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
They're trying to make trouble for us, aren't they major?

36
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,000
It could be

37
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:52,000
And the fifth child arrives to replace Oscar today

38
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,000
This whole thing is just too convenient

39
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Eya Nami

40
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:56,000
There's a feeling about her

41
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Almost as if my mother

42
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Rei and my mother

43
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,000
What are you doing with them?

44
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,000
What are you doing with them?

45
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Father

46
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Hello, Commander

47
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:09,000
Did you know my cat died?

48
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,000
The cat my grandmother was taking care of

49
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,000
I hadn't seen it for a long time

50
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,000
But now I know that I'll never see it again

51
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Why did you destroy the dummy system?

52
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,000
The cat my grandmother was taking care of

53
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,000
I hadn't seen it for a long time

54
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,000
But now I know that I'll never see it again

55
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,000
Why did you destroy the dummy system?

56
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:35,000
It wasn't the dummy system that I destroyed

57
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,000
It was Ray

58
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,000
I'll ask you once more

59
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
Why did you do it?

60
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
I'm not happy anymore

61
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Not even when you make love to me

62
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:48,000
Do whatever you want with me

63
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,000
It's never stopped you before

64
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
You disappoint me

65
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:56,000
You had no hopes or expectations of me to start with

66
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:59,000
I was nothing

67
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,000
What can I do now?

68
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,000
What mother?

69
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:10,000
Where have you disappeared to, Oscar?

70
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:13,000
But what can I even talk to her about?

71
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Could I talk about Ayanami with her?

72
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,000
All of my friends

73
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Toji

74
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
Kensuke

75
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,000
All of their homes have been destroyed

76
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,000
And now they've left

77
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Friends

78
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:29,000
I don't have anybody left

79
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,000
I could call my friend

80
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:35,000
I can't go see Ayanami again

81
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:38,000
I don't have courage to face her

82
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:43,000
I don't even know how to talk or act around her now

83
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:45,000
Asuka

84
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Misato

85
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Mother

86
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
What can I do?

87
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
What can I do?

88
00:04:51,000 --> 00:05:01,000
The song is good

89
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Singing brings joy and revitalizes the human soul

90
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:08,000
I think that song is the highest achievement of the Lilam culture

91
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:23,000
Don't you agree? Shinji Akari?

92
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:25,000
How do you know my name?

93
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,000
Everyone knows your name

94
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:31,000
I don't mean to sound rude but you're rather ignorant of your own position

95
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Oh really? Who are you?

96
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,000
I am Kaoru

97
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,000
Kaoru Nagisa

98
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,000
I am like you

99
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,000
One of the selected children

100
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,000
The fifth child

101
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
You're the fifth child?

102
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:44,000
Um Mr. Nagisa

103
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Call me Kaoru

104
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:48,000
Mr. Ikari

105
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,000
Mr. Ikari?

106
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:50,000
Oh no

107
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,000
You can call me Shinji

108
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:56,000
The fifth child has just arrived

109
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:58,000
Kaoru Nagisa

110
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,000
Kaoru of the seashore

111
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:02,000
And all of his past records have been erased

112
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
Just like Ray

113
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:05,000
But at least one record remains

114
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
He was born on the same day Second Impact occurred

115
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,000
The committee sent him directly to us

116
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,000
There must be something else

117
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:14,000
The Marduk reports file on the fifth child was classified

118
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:17,000
So I hacked into the intelligence department's computer system

119
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,000
I can't believe you did that

120
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
Oh it was worth doing

121
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:24,000
I found out where Ritsuko is

122
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:27,000
So what do you want to do about the fifth child's sync tests?

123
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,000
I don't have any tricks up my sleeve this time

124
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Let's see what he can do

125
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,000
Take it down 0.3 more

126
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,000
Yes sir

127
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,000
Are these data readouts correct?

128
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:44,000
All of the test systems are operating correctly sir

129
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Image I confirmed that there are no data errors

130
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:50,000
It's incredible that he can synchronize with unit 2

131
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,000
Even before we've reconfigured the core

132
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,000
He's amazing

133
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:56,000
But this isn't possible

134
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:59,000
Nevertheless it's happened

135
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:03,000
We must accept that fact and start an investigation into why it is so

136
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:11,000
You must be the first child am I correct?

137
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,000
You're Rei Ayanami

138
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:16,000
You are the same as I am

139
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
Identify yourself

140
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
The fifth child has made contact with Rei

141
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
I see

142
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:27,000
The magi are currently analyzing the nature of the fifth and what his powers may be

143
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:30,000
And we still don't know who or what he is

144
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
When the hell is this boy?

145
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
Shinji hasn't come back yet either

146
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
I guess I'm not deserving of his trust

147
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Is trust

148
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,000
Central dogma is now over

149
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,000
Please use route

150
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,000
Me for the transfer

151
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,000
Hello

152
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:54,000
You weren't waiting here for me

153
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,000
Where are you?

154
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,000
No

155
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:58,000
Well not really waiting anyway

156
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:00,000
So what are you doing for the rest of the day?

157
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:01,000
Well

158
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,000
Usually when tests are over

159
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,000
I'll just take a shower and go home

160
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,000
But I don't really want to go home these days

161
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:13,000
The fact that you have a place where you could return home will lead you to happiness

162
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:14,000
That is a good fact

163
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,000
You think so?

164
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,000
I want to talk to you some more

165
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,000
May I come with you?

166
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,000
To the shower I mean

167
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,000
Aren't you going to go to the shower?

168
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,000
Yeah

169
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,000
Or do you mean no?

170
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,000
No I don't mean no

171
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:39,000
You are extremely afraid of any kind of initial contact aren't you

172
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:42,000
Are you that afraid of other people?

173
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,000
I know that by keeping others at a distance

174
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,000
You avoid a betrayal of your trust

175
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,000
But while you may not be hurt that way

176
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:52,000
You mustn't forget that you must endure the loneliness

177
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:55,000
Man can never completely erase this sadness

178
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:59,000
Because all men are fundamentally alone

179
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,000
It's time

180
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,000
Time to go?

181
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,000
Yeah

182
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,000
I have to go to bed

183
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,000
With me?

184
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,000
No

185
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,000
I think you have your own room

186
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,000
That they gave you I mean

187
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Okay

188
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:24,000
You know pain is something that man must endure in his heart

189
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:29,000
And since the heart feels pain so easily some believe life is pain

190
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,000
You are delicate like glass

191
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,000
That is your heart is

192
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,000
It is?

193
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:35,000
Yes

194
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:37,000
This is worth earning my empathy

195
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,000
Empathy?

196
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,000
I'm saying I love you

197
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,000
Nerve

198
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,000
The nerve organization was established to execute the wishes of Zele

199
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,000
The wishes of Zele

200
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:55,000
It was intended to enact the scenario we had created

201
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,000
However

202
00:09:56,000 --> 00:10:00,000
It appears to have become dominated by a single zealous individual

203
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,000
Yes it has

204
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,000
We must take it back into our own dominion

205
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,000
It is time

206
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:08,000
We must restore Nerve and the Ava series to their proper roles

207
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,000
Ikari

208
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,000
You will take responsibility for betraying Zele

209
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:16,000
I'm afraid there's not much time left for accomplishing our goal

210
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,000
However

211
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:20,000
The lance of Longinus which would have impeded the realization of our plan

212
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Is now gone forever

213
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:23,000
The last angel shall soon appear

214
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:26,000
And with its destruction our wishes may be born soon Yui

215
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,000
Please have patience

216
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Why am I here?

217
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:34,000
Why am I still alive?

218
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:37,000
For what purpose?

219
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:39,000
For whose purpose?

220
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:42,000
The fifth child?

221
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:49,000
In what way are he and I alike?

222
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:53,000
Thank God this apartment block is on the outskirts of town

223
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:56,000
It's a miracle that Aiden and you survived

224
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:59,000
And I can't guarantee your safety any longer

225
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:02,000
So the Haraki family will be taking care of you

226
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:04,000
From now on

227
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:08,000
I may not see you for a while Pen Pen

228
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:18,000
I think I should sleep on the floor

229
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,000
No

230
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,000
I'm staying at your place

231
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,000
I'm fine

232
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:23,000
I'll be okay on the floor

233
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:29,000
What did you want to say to me?

234
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,000
What?

235
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,000
You wanted to tell me something didn't you?

236
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:37,000
So much has happened since I came

237
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:41,000
Before this I lived with my teacher

238
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:44,000
It was calm and boring in those days

239
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,000
I wasn't really doing anything

240
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,000
But I was fine with that

241
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:51,000
There was really nothing that I had to do

242
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:54,000
Did you hate dealing with people?

243
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,000
More or less

244
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,000
But I didn't really care as much

245
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:59,000
However I really hated my father

246
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:03,000
Why am I telling all of this to Kaoru?

247
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:10,000
I think I may have been born just to meet you Shinji Ikari

248
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
Well did you get the data on him?

249
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:14,000
Yeah this is it

250
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:17,000
I sort of borrowed it from Lieutenant Ibuki without asking

251
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:21,000
I'm sorry that I made you do something like that

252
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,000
What is this?

253
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:26,000
Yeah it's no wonder that Maya can't talk about this

254
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:28,000
It's not even theoretically possible

255
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Yeah it's getting more and more mysterious

256
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:35,000
How can he set his sync ratio at any level he chooses?

257
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:38,000
I guess it's time to go Maverick again

258
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:41,000
It's you again

259
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,000
How surprising

260
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,000
I have a question for you

261
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Our conversation is being monitored you know

262
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,000
I don't care

263
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:50,000
The fifth child what is he?

264
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
He is probably the last angel

265
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:58,000
It is time let us go Adam's dark shadow

266
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Servant of the Lilum

267
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Ava unit 2 just activated

268
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,000
That's impossible

269
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,000
Where's Asuka?

270
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,000
She's in room 303 I've confirmed it

271
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Who the hell is piloting it?

272
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:15,000
It's unmanned

273
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:18,000
The entry plug hasn't even been inserted into unit 2

274
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Unmanned?

275
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
Then the fifth child isn't there

276
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:25,000
AT field detected in central dogma

277
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,000
Ava 2?

278
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
No the blood pattern is blue

279
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,000
